'''''Sojourners' Ghastly Reverie''''' is a [[Trailblaze Continuance]] in the chapter [[A Foxian Tale of the Haunted]].

==Steps==
# Go to Swallowsong Pavilion as proposed by Cirrus and chat with Furynox
# Talk to Xueyi and come up with a strategy
# Defeat the host and collect heliobus fragments
# Go to the Verdantia Terrace to meet up with Xueyi
# Defeat Cirrus

