===Go to Swallowsong Pavilion as proposed by Cirrus and chat with Furynox{{subst:void|<!--202170401-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Fyxestroll Garden|Cirrus claims to know Furynox like the back of its hand, and proposes a game changer of a counter. But does this shifty creature really want to help humanity win? Or could it be that it secretly harbors ulterior motives? We'll never know what's up its sleeve unless we let it play its trump card. You're nervous, but you have to hold on until that trump card gets played.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''Cirrus:''' You've heard the story of Ignamar and the great heliobus's glorious fight against the general. They were an entity born of many heliobi fusing together...
:'''Cirrus:''' ...but heliobi are gradually tainted by the emotions and desires of those we possess. We tend to spite each other and don't like to fuse together &mdash; it's like having multiple personalities inside a single head. It leads to "infighting..."
:'''Cirrus:''' A powerful heliobus like Ignamar or Furynox might be able to swallow a lesser heliobus and placate them for a while...
:'''Cirrus:''' ...but this internal balance is easily broken when exposed to external forces &mdash; just like how we were torn apart and reborn after Ignamar fought the general.
:'''Xueyi:''' Therefore... this might be the way to defeat Furynox. We can cause them to break apart and reduce their power, then the Ten-Lords Commission can use their sacred vessels to seal up all of Furynox's fragments.
:'''Xueyi:''' I have a question. Why are you betraying your own kin? Why would you help the Xianzhou when we have sealed you for so long?
:'''Cirrus:''' Why? Must heliobi always have a reason for their behavior? Perhaps I don't want Furynox to devour me. Perhaps I dislike idiots who use force and nothing else. Perhaps I wish to fight the general myself...
:'''Cirrus:''' ...or maybe I just want to do a favor for the Ten-Lords Commission that will ensure I can leave here in one piece?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We should allow Cirrus to go ahead with their plan.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Don't believe Cirrus!
:'''Xueyi:''' Judges of the Ten-Lords Commission always keep our promises. If you can truly deal with the problem at hand, I will ask for your freedom from the Ten Lords. However, I cannot guarantee the outcome of the appeal.
:'''Cirrus:''' How conventional. Fine, I accept... but you better keep your promise, puppet.
:'''Cirrus:''' Hehe, me and Furynox were "furnacemates..." I know them well. They are powerful, but as naive as a child and obsessed with victory. I only need to say three things to incite them.
:'''Cirrus:''' (Trailblazer), I'll need your body for a while longer.
----
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''(Trailblazer):''' Furynox! Furynox...!
:*There is a vague sound from far away. A response, possibly.*
:'''(Trailblazer):''' Before you duel the general, why don't you fight me?
:'''Distant Voice:''' ...Cirrus? What makes you worth my time, weakling?
:'''Distant Voice:''' I've turned this garden into my territory and made the dogs of the Ten Lords my puppets! As soon as the general arrives, the heliobi will have our rematch. Why should I fight my own at this crucial moment?
:'''(Trailblazer):''' That group of amateurs you've put together? Hah. They're nothing compared to me.
:'''(Trailblazer):''' I have already obtained the most wonderful pawn for myself &mdash; a piece that once expelled Phantylia!
:'''Distant Voice:''' ...Phantylia? Phantylia! I remember! What a wonderful host... I want it!
:'''(Trailblazer):''' Then send the spiritfarers under your control to find me. If you can defeat this Nameless I'm possessing, then you can swallow me up and let my strength aid you in your fight against the general. What do you say?
:'''Distant Voice:''' Deal! My pawns and I will show you no mercy!
----
:'''Cirrus:''' See? Easy-peasy.
:'''Tail:''' Tsk, does that mean all the spiritfarers out there have fallen? What a useless army.
:'''Huohuo:''' ...Does that mean we'll be fighting our friends...?
:'''Xueyi:''' ...
:'''Cirrus:''' Oh, do puppets feel empathy? Or do you not wish to defeat Furynox anymore? We heliobi think of such matters as business transactions. As long as something can bring us victory, we will destroy everything &mdash; even allies and kin.
:'''Cirrus:''' Make the decision. Furynox's pawns &mdash; your companions &mdash; must be destroyed.
:'''Xueyi:''' ...
:'''Xueyi:''' ...Please come over here. I need to give you something.
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Talk to Xueyi and come up with a strategy{{subst:void|<!--202170403-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Fyxestroll Garden|update|Cirrus claims to know Furynox like the back of its hand, and proposes a game changer of a counter. But does this shifty creature really want to help humanity win? Or could it be that it secretly harbors ulterior motives? We'll never know what's up its sleeve unless we let it play its trump card. You're nervous, but you have to hold on until that trump card gets played.<br />With the fall of Fyxestroll Garden, the Judges' suppression of the heliobi fell short at the final hurdle. Now, the only ones the Xianzhou can count on are you and the timid Huohuo.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Xueyi)
----
:'''Xueyi:''' You two, take this before we fight Furynox.
:'''Xueyi:''' This is the Lunaumbra Gourd, a sacred vessel made by the Artisanship Commission. The Ten-Lords Commission has made some changes to it to better suppress heliobi. After you fight the puppets controlled by Furynox, make sure you seal their heliobi fragments in here.
:'''Xueyi:''' Also...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'll look after Huohuo.
::'''Xueyi:''' Her time as a judge has been brief &mdash; she is still inexperienced. Apart from that, please also have mercy on the spiritfarers that have fallen under Furynox's control.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'll go easy on the spiritfarers.
::'''Xueyi:''' The Ten Lords will not forget your acts of kindness. Thank you.
:'''Huohuo:''' Mr. Tail, we're gonna fight some really dangerous enemies now. Please lend me your strength, too.
:'''Tail:''' Oh-ho? Sounds like someone finally learned to talk tough.
:'''Tail:''' I would've believed you if your legs weren't shaking so much!
:'''Huohuo:''' Don't point that out! It took me a lot of effort to be this brave! All this time I've just been hiding behind {{MC|м=Mr.|ж=Miss}} (Trailblazer). I'm such a bad judge...
:'''Huohuo:''' Madam Xueyi said those possessed by a heliobus can't get possessed again... I'm the only person who can help everyone!
:'''Tail:''' Exactly! You're welcome, by the way... So, what are we waiting for? Let's go!
:'''Xueyi:''' Huohuo, though I am of ingenium body, I too am feeling a sliver of fear.
:'''Huohuo:''' Madam Xueyi... you're afraid too?
:'''Xueyi:''' Faced with a demon that can manipulate life at will, of course I'm afraid... Afraid that I won't ever work with my sister again.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Huohuo, I'm afraid too.
::'''Huohuo:''' ...I&mdash;I guess if even you two are afraid, then... I&mdash;I feel a little better now.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Afraid or not, we're still gonna beat the heck out of it!
:'''Xueyi:''' Let's go! I will find my own way to defeat the pawns possessed by Furynox... and before that foolish heliobus has realized what's happening, I will suppress all of their fragments within the Lunaumbra Gourd.
:'''Huohuo:''' ...So we'll need to activate the Evil Binding Matrix, right?
:'''Xueyi:''' Once my task is done, I will meet you at the Verdantia Terrace and activate the Evil Binding Matrix at its matrix core.
:'''Huohuo:''' Okay.
----
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Huohuo:''' Those are... possessed Wraith Wardens...
:'''Tail:''' Don't expect me to hold back.

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Huohuo:''' If Furynox is so powerful, why would they allow themself to break apart so easily?
:'''Cirrus:''' The stronger you are, the more you underestimate your enemies... sometimes being weak and humble is the way to survive.
